- I would have to say

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:35.113
about six years ago for
a good three years there.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:43.480
Well you see, I met my ex in 2011.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.160
Not my baby's daddy, but my ex.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.323
His name is Ace. He's a black dude.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.020
I met him in 2011,

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:56.933
and he just recently broke
up with me about a month ago.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:02.240
I can say that my happiest that I've been

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:03.190
that I can remember

00:16:05.075 --> 00:16:08.533
is the first couple years
when we were together.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.190
He definitely had been the best thing

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.450
for me in my life as well.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.283
He...

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:23.440
I get healthy when I'm around him.

00:16:26.476 --> 00:16:28.073
And I start to gain weight.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.370
I feel happier, and everybody around me

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:34.930
says I look happier, but...

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:40.630
The reason why we're not together anymore

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:43.090
is he broke up with me 'cause I kind of...

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.933
I pushed him to.

00:16:46.933 --> 00:16:47.885
- [Mark] You what?

00:16:47.885 --> 00:16:51.153
- I pushed him to do. I kept egging it on.

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.010
Kept doing things

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:57.707
that I knew would upset 'em.

00:17:03.847 --> 00:17:08.373
And I don't know why,
but still to this day,

00:17:10.381 --> 00:17:13.467
he would come right back and
get me if I tell 'em to, but

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:15.393
I don't.

00:17:15.393 --> 00:17:18.663
The reason I don't is 'cause
I feel I don't deserve 'em.

00:17:25.982 --> 00:17:28.330
- [Mark] Was there love in
the childhood that you had

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.483
back in Utah?

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.293
In your family?

00:17:36.187 --> 00:17:38.777
- (indistinct)

00:17:38.777 --> 00:17:40.303
- [Mark] Do you feel like
you were loved as a child?

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:43.420
- Not really. I just feel like...

00:17:47.378 --> 00:17:48.303
Growing up,

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:52.593
even up until I left home,

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.430
not once did I ever hear

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.460
from my siblings or mom or dad

00:18:00.307 --> 00:18:02.907
that I was beautiful, pretty,
or anything like that.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:07.903
No one at home says, you
know, good looking, beautiful.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.575
I didn't hear... the very first person...

00:18:12.575 --> 00:18:15.575
The first time I heard anyone
tell me I was beautiful was...

00:18:18.587 --> 00:18:22.153
was in March of 2011
when I met Ace, my ex.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:26.850
He was the first one to tell me.

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.170
- [Mark] What's the most important lesson

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.803
you think you've learned in life?

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.650
- Open your eyes to the
blessings that you have.

00:18:54.464 --> 00:18:56.631
Don't take 'em for granted

00:18:58.135 --> 00:18:59.365
because you'll look (indistinct)

00:18:59.365 --> 00:19:00.997
when you open your eyes 'cause it's gone.

00:19:04.063 --> 00:19:06.313
(sniffing)

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:11.790
To not give up.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:15.590
That's why I am where
I am today, I believe

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:20.627
'cause I stopped caring,
and gave up on myself.

00:19:25.555 --> 00:19:27.638
(sniffs)

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:35.130
After I lost my son, I feel
like there's nothing (sniffs)

00:19:37.738 --> 00:19:39.405
to live for anymore.

00:19:42.121 --> 00:19:46.288
(outside chatter and city noises)

00:19:56.575 --> 00:20:00.325
(Vicky sniffing and sobbing)

00:20:01.492 --> 00:20:02.325
Sorry.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:12.340
- [Mark] Alright, Vicky.
Thank you for talking with me.

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.136
- [Vicky] No problem.
Sorry. (light chuckle)

00:20:14.136 --> 00:20:16.945
- [Mark] It's okay. You're
going through a lot.

00:20:16.945 --> 00:20:17.778
- [Vicky] Hmm?

00:20:17.778 --> 00:20:18.611
- [Mark] You've been through a lot,

00:20:18.611 --> 00:20:19.444
and you're going through a lot.

